        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 07de22e8-7b6d-4db9-a2f5-f9e88e41af8f).Image",
        "Description": "Word on the street is there are some aliens in town! Carlo and Alberto are Zlopawopian shape shifters who came to this planet to cut off human ballsacks and replace them with 2 of their 40 million testicles. These new alien ballsacks are an improvement in every way, and quite frankly, I don&apos;t want that kind of competition in this world. For that reason, you must also take out Paciano Anzaldo, bodyguard by day, kinky furry femboy by night. Paciano received a new set of super balls, so kill him.",
